<div id="S7.SS5.p2" class="ltx_para">
<p id="S7.SS5.p2.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="S7.SS5.p2.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_smallcaps">SplitAgent</span>’s intelligent budget management achieves:</p>
<ul id="S7.I4" class="ltx_itemize">
<li id="S7.I4.i1" class="ltx_item" style="list-style-type:none;"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_item">•</span> 
<div id="S7.I4.i1.p1" class="ltx_para">
<p id="S7.I4.i1.p1.1" class="ltx_p">34.2 total utility vs. 24.3 for naive allocation</p>
</div></li>
<li id="S7.I4.i2" class="ltx_item" style="list-style-type:none;"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_item">•</span> 
<div id="S7.I4.i2.p1" class="ltx_para">
<p id="S7.I4.i2.p1.1" class="ltx_p">96% task completion rate</p>
</div></li>
<li id="S7.I4.i3" class="ltx_item" style="list-style-type:none;"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_item">•</span> 
<div id="S7.I4.i3.p1" class="ltx_para">
<p id="S7.I4.i3.p1.1" class="ltx_p">Efficient budget utilization (85% used)</p>
</div></li>
<li id="S7.I4.i4" class="ltx_item" style="list-style-type:none;"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_item">•</span> 
<div id="S7.I4.i4.p1" class="ltx_para">
<p id="S7.I4.i4.p1.1" class="ltx_p">Graceful degradation as budget depletes</p>
</div></li>
</ul>
</div>
</section>
